#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0049 expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "The accessor-form provider-absent pin for the list-valued var_codelist_coded_values reads. The file carries no #library line of any kind, so the Library provider is null and the rule reports no Library metadata available. The dataset block is identical to CDISC-SEND-0049-invalid-DM, so the fixture is discriminating."
dataset DM class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label=Demographics
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SEX     type=Char label="Sex"
col SPECIES type=Char label="Species"
---
S1 | DM | 001 | M | RAT
S1 | DM | 002 | X | HAMSTER
S1 | DM | 003 |   | MOUSE
